---
// DraftSlot.astro — ONE PIECE OF A BLANK RESIDENT PAGE, TYPED INTO WHERE IT SITS (CORE-188). Darko, 2026-11-26 10:15 EST: "instead of having a
// separate form that we fill for the preview, we should just allow form filling directly in the preview shape of the resident form itself,
// especially because the dotted lines currently look like you can click them to like fill them in." So in a draft (the join's blank page), each
// piece ResidentFace.astro and AddressCardFace.astro would print is this instead: the box itself, in the page's own type (it inherits the font,
// size and colour of the spot it stands in), its ghost as the placeholder, the dotted outline as the "type here" cue while its step is lit, and
// beside it the live count (shown while the box has focus) and the piece's problem (shown as soon as it's wrong). The resident page never draws
// a draft, so none of this reaches it. Styles: src/styles/resident-page.css § A BLANK INSTANCE OF THE PAGE.
//
// The hooks are the join's (town/pages/join/move-in.astro): the box is `#jd-<name>` with `data-piece`, the count `data-count-for`, the problem
// `data-problem-for`, and the wrapper `data-fill` (which piece it is; is-lit when its step is the one being filled). It starts read-only: the join
// lights the current step's pieces and leaves the rest reading as the page.
interface Props { name: string; ghost: string; label: string; multiline?: boolean; rows?: number }
const { name, ghost, label, multiline = false, rows = 1 } = Astro.props;
const countId = `jd-count-${name}`;
const problemId = `jd-problem-${name}`;
const box = { id: `jd-${name}`, name, "data-piece": name, placeholder: ghost, "aria-label": label, "aria-describedby": `${countId} ${problemId}`, autocomplete: "off", readonly: true, tabindex: -1, class: "draft-in" };
---
<span class={`draft-slot${multiline ? " is-long" : ""}`} data-fill={name} data-slot={name}>{multiline
  ? <textarea rows={rows} {...box}></textarea>
  : <input type="text" size={Math.max(3, [...ghost].length)} {...box} />}<span class="draft-tips"><span class="draft-count" id={countId} data-count-for={name} aria-live="polite"></span><span class="draft-problem" id={problemId} data-problem-for={name} aria-live="polite"></span></span></span>
